            <div class="bg-paper p-3.5 rounded-lg border border-line space-y-1.5 text-muted">
              <p>1. <span class="text-emerald-600 font-bold">REJECT 规则集：</span> 拦截常见广告追踪与遥测域名 (GeoSite: category-ads-all)</p>
              <p>2. <span class="text-pine font-bold">DIRECT 直连规则集：</span> 国内主流域名与内网私有网段 (GeoSite: cn, GeoIP: private, cn)</p>
              <p>3. <span class="text-blue-600 font-bold">🤖 AI 特调策略组：</span> openai, chatgpt, anthropic, claude (指向美西/台湾原生住宅)</p>
